<div class="gh-seed-stack gh-seed-stack--inputs">
  <div>
    <label class="gh-col-label" for="<%= prefix %>-soil-<%= n %>">🪴 The Soil — Where you're starting</label>
    <p class="gh-facet-prompt">Start by naming the feeling, experience, or pattern you hope to shift away from.</p>
    <textarea class="gh-textarea" id="<%= prefix %>-soil-<%= n %>" rows="3"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div>
    <label class="gh-col-label" for="<%= prefix %>-seed-<%= n %>">🌱 The Seed — What you're growing</label>
    <p class="gh-facet-prompt">What's a change you want to work towards? Name the feeling or way of being you're reaching for.</p>
    <textarea class="gh-textarea" id="<%= prefix %>-seed-<%= n %>" rows="3"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div>
    <label class="gh-col-label" for="<%= prefix %>-water-<%= n %>">💧 The Water — How you'll tend it</label>
    <p class="gh-facet-prompt">What does this change ask from you?</p>
    <textarea class="gh-textarea" id="<%= prefix %>-water-<%= n %>" rows="3"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div>
    <label class="gh-col-label" for="<%= prefix %>-bloom-<%= n %>">🌸 The Bloom — What success looks like</label>
    <p class="gh-facet-prompt">Picture a regular day once this change has taken root. What are you doing differently?</p>
    <textarea class="gh-textarea" id="<%= prefix %>-bloom-<%= n %>" rows="3"></textarea>
  </div>
</div>
